sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant W as Assistant widget<br/>AG-UI 1.0 client
    participant E as TYPO3<br/>POST /api/agent-nexus/ag-ui
    participant M as Model (nr-llm, optional)
    V->>W: asks a question
    W->>E: RunAgentInput (threadId, runId, messages)
    E-->>W: RUN_STARTED (protocolVersion 1.0)
    E-->>W: REASONING_START … REASONING_END
    E->>M: stream the answer
    M-->>E: text chunks
    E-->>W: TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT …
    E-->>W: ACTIVITY_SNAPSHOT (plan comparison)
    E-->>W: TOOL_CALL_START / ARGS / END
    E-->>W: RUN_FINISHED (outcome: interrupt)
    Note over V,W: approval form from responseSchema
    V->>W: confirms and sends
    W->>E: RunAgentInput (same thread, resume)
    E-->>W: TOOL_CALL_RESULT (same tool call)
    E-->>W: RUN_FINISHED (outcome: success, result)
